While the TV media has completely blacked it out, @CJP_2029 has been protesting overnight at Jantar Mantar demanding the resignation of Minister Dharmendra Pradhan. 

This is despite EVERY attempt by the BJP to force them out using the police. Our youth are standing strong! 

Pls join them today in Delhi if you can. This is about the future of our students & our education system. 

Keep up the good fight @abhijeet_dipke 
@SauravDassss @VijetaDahiya @AshutoshRanka and EVERYONE participating! Proud of you all! 

