@neha_aisa and @Dipankar_cpiml and more? I think clarity on whether Dipke continues fast most welcome @SauravDassss. At the same time I understand his wife @GitanjaliAngmo’s fears for her husband but right now this looks government has not given an inch. VIDEO | Delhi: At Jantar Mantar, Sonam Wangchuk's wife Gitanjali Angmo says, "Sonam will end his hunger strike tomorrow if political leaders meet him at hospital and assure him that they will raise the issue of education accountability during Parliament session."

